{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-85","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：截差无理线段","englishTitle":"To find the first apotome.","book":10,"number":85,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.85","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.85/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":85,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","contentId":"euclid-10-85","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"218307b832f01b60986e1477580c742293e50d3d4c3915138912d204e520338a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-85.statement","euclid-10-85.construction.1","euclid-10-85.construction.2","euclid-10-85.construction.3","euclid-10-85.proof.1","euclid-10-85.proof.2","euclid-10-85.proof.3","euclid-10-85.proof.4","euclid-10-85.construction.4","euclid-10-85.proof.5","euclid-10-85.proof.6","euclid-10-85.proof.7","euclid-10-85.proof.8","euclid-10-85.proof.9","euclid-10-85.proof.10","euclid-10-85.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-85.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa84e6d20285052f865232e34fa1ccb720ce72ab541ab0b8027989598b39f22b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the first apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第一个截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32080c7519b24ff93b5cb609dc5bcc3e7ff0e1c49a4dd47ef2516cc4111aec69","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line A be set out, and let BG be commensurable in length with A; therefore BG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"准备有理线段、A让BG是长度可公度和A;因此,BG也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72160b79d1983ca2d4d7f073499214c5f74b54498118c8d76050cd88635fbebe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two square numbers DE, EF be set out, and let their difference FD not be square; therefore neither has ED to DF the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个平方数 DE EF,让FD的差额不为正方形;因此,ED至DF的比例都与平方数的比例不相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe9ab52ac5102140c399162e4d467926115e54d58b2ec16266c187b7c0ac1736","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as ED is to DF, so is the square on BG to the square on GC; [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on BG is commensurable with the square on GC. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设ED比DF等于BG比正方形比GC比正方形,因此BG比正方形等于可公度比正方形 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"190ae23b50fbfc118416a696ff2c7b1905982cd2430e47c4fd43b4e283b4560b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on BG is rational; therefore the square on GC is also rational; therefore GC is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BG的正方形是有理;GC的正方形也是有理;GC也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a69c99167e070a3d54aeaca1dc17bade75b04dcd8329b62e299fa8dc5069fe8f","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since ED has not to DF the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on BG to the square on GC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BG is incommensurable in length with GC. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于ED的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,DF的比例为平方数,GC的比例为正方形,正方形的比例为正方形,GC的比例为平方数,BG的比例为不可公度,GC的比例为不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5913d84aaf875dd0d83d05ee2ee10d01ebf3f8332c4ca2ef6600c69d8b0c8f2a","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore BG, GC are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore BC is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,BG,GC是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,BC是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e08e5ab5f57f3b41f98bed505a10b3898beb4764bc27f0dfe0253ee7f93f6dcd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a first apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第一个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12f43399c5c390ec780ed869f686d43238d4f72fc8d0ccba7d782488cfb83f0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square on H be that by which the square on BG is greater than the square on GC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"H正方形BG正方形比GC正方形大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"933d85c33be8d6ce8b051aa4745fcf947a0f04972ab402dd6b364652f0745538","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since. as ED is to FD, so is the square on BG to the square on GC, therefore also, convertendo, [[v. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)] as DE is to EF, so is the square on GB to the square on H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从现在起,ED比FD等于BG比正方形,GC比正方形,因此,转换率DE比EF等于GB比正方形比比正方形（相关点与线段：H） [[v. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1182842cf427de8f372f998185af7205d12f466b68092ef5471f8bccc56e2584","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DE has to EF the ratio which a square number has to a square number, for each is square; therefore the square on GB also has to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BG is commensurable in length with H. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DE的比例为EF,平方数的比例为平方数,平方数的比例为平方数,平方数的比例为平方数;因此,GB的比例为正方形,H的比例为正方形,平方数的比例为平方数,平方数的比例为平方数;因此,BG的比例为长度可公度,H。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b1413fd2c2b21ceeedec938957ea66b031871c7df4d46d73bf55e2856d17e25","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on BG is greater than the square on GC by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG的正方形比GC的正方形 和正方形直线长度可公度和BG的正方形还要高"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f1c20826e315e6c4183116a5b0fd48f3df8178ae61b0479b34e6758057ec8a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the whole BG is commensurable in length with the rational straight line A set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"整个BG是长度可公度 有理线段、A设置。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b93a24b3a657bd7b864d9012c79426f9b41657babce017803c0e6d61397966e8","citations":["euclid-10-def-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is a first apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以BC是第一个截差无理线段 [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72158a720bf267ebe4163a25649279eec61699f90fca871ddb1ccf3666f9fec7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the first apotome BC has been found. (Being) that which it was required to find."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现了第一批截差无理线段 BC件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-85.source","contentId":"euclid-10-85","revisionId":"euclid-10-85@raw-218307b832f01b60","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a480618830ca56db977152424ca3b61aa0bb8f9d1384c1d6d15ddb7ed5e73960","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metada